{"id":616,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自主性と探究心を伸ばす県立中高一貫教育","feature_description":"長崎東中学校は、県立の中高一貫教育を通じて、基礎学力を確実に身に付け、自ら学び続ける力を育てます。教科の学習と探究的な活動を結び、課題を発見し、情報を活用して考えを表現する経験を重ねます。行事や学校生活で多様な仲間と協働し、互いを尊重しながら目標に向かう姿勢を培い、社会の変化に主体的に対応できる人を目指します。未来につながる学びを進めます。","clubs":[],"profile_sources":[{"id":3554,"attribute_key":"feature_summary","source_url":"https://www.news.ed.jp/higashi-h/","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-08-10","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null},{"id":3555,"attribute_key":"feature_description","source_url":"https://www.news.ed.jp/higashi-h/","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-08-10","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null}]}
